{"term": {"label": "禮", "occurrences": 3, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-ii", "title": "滕文公下", "description": "陳代曰：「不見諸侯，宜若小然；今一見之，大則以王，小則以霸。且志曰：『枉尺而直尋』，宜若可為也。」\n孟子曰：「昔齊景公田，招虞人以旌，不至，將殺之。志士不忘在溝壑，勇士不忘喪其元。孔子奚取焉？取非其招不往也，如不待其招而往，何哉？且夫枉尺而直尋者，以利言也。如以利，則枉尋直尺而利，亦可為與？昔者趙簡子使王良與嬖奚乘，終"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "仲子", "id": "仲子"}, {"form": "何", "id": "何"}, {"form": "又", "id": "又"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "征", "id": "征"}, {"form": "志", "id": "志"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "楚", "id": "楚"}, {"form": "欲", "id": "欲"}, {"form": "殺", "id": "殺"}, {"form": "由", "id": "由"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}, {"form": "齊", "id": "齊"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.7097858862683823, "source": "齊", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 1.9974679587201634, "source": "齊", "target": "楚"}, {"weight": 0.45702291777301435, "source": "齊", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 1.304320778160218, "source": "齊", "target": "欲"}, {"weight": 1.9974679587201634, "source": "齊", "target": "仲子"}, {"weight": 1.9611003145492885, "source": "子", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.9611003145492885, "source": "子", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.1726429541850183, "source": "子", "target": "食"}, {"weight": 1.1501700983329597, "source": "子", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 1.6734182420975077, "source": "子", "target": "志"}, {"weight": 1.267953133989343, "source": "子", "target": "征"}, {"weight": 1.9611003145492885, "source": "子", "target": "殺"}, {"weight": 1.555635206441124, "source": "子", "target": "欲"}, {"weight": 2.1152509943765465, "source": "仲子", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 0.8159680102462858, "source": "食", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.9145802989143956, "source": "食", "target": "志"}, {"weight": 0.45702291777301435, "source": "何", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.0166387057084372, "source": "何", "target": "志"}, {"weight": 2.520716102484711, "source": "惡", "t